{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103720/extras/6c847b84f06b00db60ca3f7a47a55330.avif?t=1761568622\" width=400 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">...Vincent: Mansion of The Dead is a Halloween flavored twin-stick arena shooter with survivors-like mechanics and low-poly pixel art graphics.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The ghost Winry who lives in her secluded mansion is the prime target of the Dark Lord Thanatos, who wishes to collect her soul. The Dark Lord has deemed that she has lived for too long and is sending his army to collect her debt. Team up with her vessel Vincent and fend off the evil spirits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103720/extras/86ff50c49ac255e6dc64dab1a205bc87.webp?t=1761568622\" width=170 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hack, Slash, Dash, Gain EXP, Level Up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103720/extras/cec809fa4dfbc8bf0c41ae594406b90f.poster.avif?t=1761568622\" width=260 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103720/extras/cec809fa4dfbc8bf0c41ae594406b90f.webm?t=1761568622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103720/extras/cec809fa4dfbc8bf0c41ae594406b90f.mp4?t=1761568622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103720/extras/5ad840a2743d9f1a3ba8e61e3b98913c.poster.avif?t=1761568622\" width=260 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103720/extras/5ad840a2743d9f1a3ba8e61e3b98913c.webm?t=1761568622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103720/extras/5ad840a2743d9f1a3ba8e61e3b98913c.mp4?t=1761568622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The gameplay is fairly simplistic but you can control the direction your character can attack and also evade incoming attacks by dashing! several upgrades exist to buff your DPS and improve your move set! Each run you will earn skill points between runs which can be used to permanently buff your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Feel powerful enough for a challenge? Increase the difficulty threefold!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103720/extras/56949ce5bd3d9093e5055d476b732938.poster.avif?t=1761568622\" width=258 height=74 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103720/extras/56949ce5bd3d9093e5055d476b732938.webm?t=1761568622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103720/extras/56949ce5bd3d9093e5055d476b732938.mp4?t=1761568622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Alongside Vincent and Winry,\u00a0<strong>Meet 7 comrades and unlikely allies</strong> along the way! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each with their own move sets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You can also create your own custom character to team up alongside using the .vrm file format!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103720/extras/05ad4980da5f8e09ed3c0e9d808a5ffa.poster.avif?t=1761568622\" width=358 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103720/extras/05ad4980da5f8e09ed3c0e9d808a5ffa.webm?t=1761568622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103720/extras/05ad4980da5f8e09ed3c0e9d808a5ffa.mp4?t=1761568622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Converse with your allies in the &quot;Winry Mystery Mansion&quot; hub world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The game supports Keyboard + Mouse, and Controller</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Extra Info</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Original Soundtrack by: Daniel Redstone</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4103720?t=1761568622","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4103720?t=1761568622","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103720/065b7a1c89ba0731ddd8f647db77222b0e77aa2c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761568622","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103720/065b7a1c89ba0731ddd8f647db77222b0e77aa2c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761568622","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4114850,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103720/extras/6c847b84f06b00db60ca3f7a47a55330.avif?t=1761568622\" width=400 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">...Vincent: Mansion of The Dead is a Halloween flavored twin-stick arena shooter with survivors-like mechanics and low-poly pixel art graphics.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The ghost Winry who lives in her secluded mansion is the prime target of the Dark Lord Thanatos, who wishes to collect her soul. The Dark Lord has deemed that she has lived for too long and is sending his army to collect her debt. Team up with her vessel Vincent and fend off the evil spirits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103720/extras/86ff50c49ac255e6dc64dab1a205bc87.webp?t=1761568622\" width=170 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hack, Slash, Dash, Gain EXP, Level Up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103720/extras/cec809fa4dfbc8bf0c41ae594406b90f.poster.avif?t=1761568622\" width=260 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103720/extras/cec809fa4dfbc8bf0c41ae594406b90f.webm?t=1761568622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:/